Metadata-Version: 2.4
Name: culprit-shared
Version: 0.1.0
Summary: Pydantic contracts shared between api and worker — the single source of truth for wire formats both sides must agree on (e.g. the raw_events row shape written by api/app/ingest_gateway and read by worker/app/consumer.py), instead of each side hand-reimplementing the other's schema.
Requires-Python: >=3.12
Requires-Dist: pydantic>=2.9
